# The embedded build of the gallery: two megabytes of base64 that git would
# store afresh every time any one screenshot changes. The MODE is kept - it is
# what the Artifact needs and what makes the page work offline - but the output
# is rebuilt on demand rather than versioned:
#
#   node gallery/assemble.mjs --embed
